WEBVTT

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.580
It's time for another warning.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.550
Haven't I told you not to sit so close to the screen?

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.880
This day has come at last!
My first wedding with my husband!

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.080
Silly, don't add a "first" to that!

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.340
We'll be together forever.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:33.380
My darling...

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.600
Rizel...

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.010
I'll be the best child bride ever!

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:14.190
Hafuun! Total Makeover with "Adult Goods"!?

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.190
Here you go, Darling!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.170
Say, Darling...

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:30.870
I think I might be pregnant!

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.430
Wow, that's great, Rizel!

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.060
Darling!

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:41.300
Twins!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:42.860
I've come up with names for them!

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:43.780
Oh?

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:45.690
Rizenori and Tomol!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.230
Congratulations, my children!

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.910
They're all grown up...

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:58.700
You'll never grow up, will you?

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.440
No, because I'm a child bride!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.050
Hafun, it's our first diamond anniversary!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.200
You sure are lively!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.530
Because I'm a child bride!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.170
Rizel-chan! Rizel-chan!

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:17.460
Here comes Sensei!

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:18.800
Look!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:26.710
Wow, Natsumi-sensei looks so lovely!

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:28.720
Huh? Where's <i>my</i>  husband?

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:37.240
What's wrong, Darling?
You look really pale.

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.920
Darling? Darling!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:41.650
AOI-CHAN KICK!!!

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.550
That hurt! The hell was that for?!

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:49.760
He's gotten his color back!

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:51.640
You're an absolute disgrace, Iwaki-kun!

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:53.600
I already know all about...

00:03:53.600 --> 00:03:57.120
...that hot, affectionate kiss
that you and Rizel shared back then!

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:59.040
Nooooo!!

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:01.360
You have a warped imagination!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:07.230
That was a meaningless, emotionless, everyday case of...

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.730
...mouth-to-mouth resuscitation!

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:13.140
There you go again!
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:16.940
Now that we've had our first kiss,
we're a proper couple!

00:04:17.050 --> 00:04:20.520
The hell we are, you idiot! A first kiss
has to be on a date, or it doesn't count!

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.320
It's supposed to be an uplifting, stimulating experience!

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:27.150
Kissing someone when the mood is just right is what defines an adult relationship!

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:31.240
I'm going to continue my search for
a quality older woman to share that with.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.950
So I'm going to ignore you for the rest of my life!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:37.370
Ooh! My first taste of
the 48 basic sumo techniques!

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:38.640
Hey, now!

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.240
This is a wedding ceremony,
not a sumo training hall!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:44.120
We're sorry.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.000
You'd better be sure to catch this!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.200
Here!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:57.390
A bride's bouquet is a sign
of happiness to come!

00:04:57.740 --> 00:04:59.730
It just might be your turn next, Rizel-chan.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.940
Okay!

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:03.360
Hinomaru Construction

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.360
Why am I such a cake eater?

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:12.660
Rizel?!

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:15.160
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.360
W-W-Why the hell are you here?!

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:21.370
I realized we haven't done a lot of
the things that newlyweds do.

00:05:21.370 --> 00:05:23.620
So let's wash each other!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:26.300
AW, HELL NO!

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:32.320
My husband seems to have cheered up a bit!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:34.690
What's that?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:41.400
Hmm, it says here that it's for me.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.340
There must be something inside...

00:05:58.320 --> 00:06:00.540
It won't open!

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.980
Ooh, I hate this!

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.960
Meow, what's this?

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.660
Wow, I'm all grown up, meow!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.430
Hey, that's right! With this body...

00:06:26.940 --> 00:06:29.530
Meow! My husband will be so surprised!

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.110
A funding shortage in the national budget?

00:06:32.110 --> 00:06:33.860
Please tell me it's not for this house.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.150
Darling!

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:40.410
Oh, he isn't here...
Meow, where could he be?

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.530
Darling...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:47.250
A girl in glasses... with cat ears... and to top it off, a sexy body...!

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.800
Ahh, she's too good to be true!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.530
That's strange, meow...

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.470
Who was that?

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:58.170
I've found you!

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.720
Meow, meow! What do you think, meow?

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.210
What are you doing?

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:08.120
Huh? What do you mean?
Come on, aren't I sexy?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:11.690
Quit fooling around. I keep telling you,
I'm not interested in kids.

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:13.960
But why...?

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.620
Why, why?! Was it a dream?

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:19.790
It was not a dream!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:25.830
When you kissed Tomonori-kun on the Kissing Rocks,
your body became that of an adult.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:30.210
In other words, we briefly saw
your cellular structure in its mature form.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:34.840
Your body is frozen in the form of a twelve-year-old...

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.230
...so your Mamas developed this capsule
to force your body to retain its developed state.

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:42.230
However, in practice, the capsule's powers
only last 3 minutes.

00:07:42.230 --> 00:07:45.640
You did indeed become a grown-up, cat-eared girl in glasses...

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.860
but when the time ran out,
you reverted to your original form.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:51.600
I see! So I really <i>did</i>  become a grown-up!

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:54.810
Say, Papas, don't you have any more of those?

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:58.740
If I could just become a grown-up,
I think I could get all lovey-dovey with my husband!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:00.530
So it's come to that...

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:01.450
So you don't?

00:08:01.450 --> 00:08:04.370
We figured that it would come to this, Rizel...

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.910
Whoa, this is amazing! What <i>is</i>  it?

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.930
This is a machine that will dispense many capsules, Rizel!

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.630
Also known as "Gacha-Gacha".

00:08:17.630 --> 00:08:21.560
If you turn that dial,
one capsule will come out.

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:27.640
You're right! One came out!
Though I wish I could see inside it...

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:29.090
That's naﾃｯve thinking, Rizel!

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:32.770
It's much more fun if you don't know
what you're going to get.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:33.630
Really?

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:34.990
Yes, indeed.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.990
Okay, I'll try it out right away!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:49.440
WHOA! She suddenly became an exemplary specimen of a cute waitress-outfit girl!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.170
He knows his fetishes...

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.340
Do I look good? Do I?

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:55.060
I'm out of here!

00:08:55.060 --> 00:08:58.070
Tomonori-kun might've been on his way to the bookstore.

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.800
Be careful!

00:09:00.180 --> 00:09:02.720
Hmph. Passion, shmassion.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.070
I'm sorry! Ah! Dar-

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.280
This feeling...

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:18.430
This is...!

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.830
Is this "passion"?

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:30.120
Ah... er... I'm...

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.090
Ahh!! The collar timer is ringing.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.170
Sorry, there's something I have to take care of!

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:46.270
Was he trying to ask me out?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.600
Be sure not to waste them!

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:52.520
Thank you, Papas!

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.250
Okay, I'm off!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:59.190
Don't forget your time limit!

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:03.160
Are you...?

00:10:03.720 --> 00:10:06.200
Ah! Oh, about before...

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:08.300
So, you work part-time at that restaurant?

00:10:08.300 --> 00:10:10.620
Yes, that's right. And I work here, too.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.830
Hey, would you...

00:10:17.820 --> 00:10:19.170
W-Will you...

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:22.970
It's no use, I can't say it!

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:29.770
What is it? I don't have much time...

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:33.850
Well... er...

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.610
I-I'm just too nervous!

00:10:43.140 --> 00:10:46.660
Oh, no! Sorry again!
I'm out of time, so I'll see you later!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.380
This one just might strike the final blow.

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:01.160
Darling!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.300
Huh? He isn't here...

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:07.510
Damn it, where did she run off to?

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:10.750
I don't have much time!
Where have you gone, Darling?

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:14.140
All I have to say is, "Will you go out on a date with me?", isn't it?

00:11:14.140 --> 00:11:15.850
I'm such a wuss!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:16.900
There he is!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:18.150
There she is!

00:11:22.860 --> 00:11:25.780
Er... so you're a maid, too?

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:28.080
Yes. I'll serve your every need!

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:32.540
No, no, no! Get a grip, man!

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.610
It can't be... already?

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:36.760
Um... say...

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:37.500
Yes?

00:11:37.500 --> 00:11:40.920
W-Will you... will you...

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:43.590
It's all over! I'm going to switch! I'm going to switch back!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.550
Will you go out on a date with me?

00:11:49.840 --> 00:11:50.720
Yes!

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:56.720
I'll be waiting for you this Sunday by the clock tower!

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.160
I've been asked out!

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:08.980
Yes, yes, yes!!!

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:16.670
Darling!

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:19.670
Let's have a fun date this Sunday!

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.300
What're you talking about?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:26.340
I already have far better plans,
and they don't involve you, dummy.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:36.030
Hmmf! You won't be able to resist
my adult goods!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:38.770
Darling, you stupidhead!

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:12.980
It's my first date with my husband, rain or shine!

00:14:12.980 --> 00:14:14.060
Now for a quick Haiku:

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.860
"In the springtime rain,
she gets quite soakingly wet,
the charming young bride."

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:20.820
What, it isn't springtime? You'll never grow up
if you keep obsessing over details!

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.830
Or rather, you'll never be <i>able</i>  to grow up, boys!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.160
Hafun! It's my first date with my husband!

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.820
I'll run and play out in the rain
and get dripping wet!

00:14:31.820 --> 00:14:34.910
But he still hasn't shown up!
I wish he'd at least send word.

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:38.660
Now, some verses from
"Cherry Boy" in Nagoya:

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:42.480
"In the rains of fall,
the soaking wet child bride
becomes all grown up.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.380
A new flavor is added:
the bittersweet taste of love."

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:47.710
Whew... okay. There's still more to come, boys!

00:14:47.710 --> 00:14:50.850
Maybe we can get together again when you've grown up, too!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.440
Now, I wonder if my husband is ever going to show up...
